    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to find a reason to keep fighting it. like i spend so much energy just trying to exist and be seen, but the more i try, the more it feels like i'm just shouting into a void. if nothing i do actually matters to the world, what's the point of trying so hard to stay in it? it i just let go go go go, it and the nobody",
